      children: "Mahabharata ki kahani mein yeh ek anokha kshan hai. Arjuna ne Krishna ko pehle dekha ek saarthi ke roop mein, phir ek shikshak ke roop mein, phir ek mitra ke roop mein. Nau adhyayon tak Krishna ne karm, jnana, bhakti, dhyan — sab baatein kahi hain. Ab Arjuna kuch aur poochhta hai: \"Krishna, yeh sab sunkar meri aankhein khul gayi hain — lekin main tumhe kaise jaanoon? Tumne kaha ki tum sab kuch ho — lekin main toh sirf ek saarthi dekhta hoon. Tumhari asli shakti kya hai?\""
